<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-suishu" book-id="b-suishu-041" chapter-id="c-suishu-041-zhanglihua-gaojiong" source-id="s-suishu-041-zhanglihua-gaojiong-ws11122985">
  <p id="c-suishu-041-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-suishu-041-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0000" ref="goh_vpj_95z_A">高熲</persName>，字<persName id="c-suishu-041-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0004" ref="goh_vpj_95z_A">昭玄</persName>，一名<persName id="c-suishu-041-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0009" ref="goh_vpj_95z_A">敏</persName>，自雲渤海蓚人也。父<persName id="c-suishu-041-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0020" ref="goh_vpj_95z">賓</persName>，</p>
  <p id="c-suishu-041-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">九年，<persName id="c-suishu-041-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p002:m0003" ref="ce8_yhf_283_AAAAAAA">晉王廣</persName>大舉伐陳，以熲為元帥長史，三軍諮稟，皆取斷於熲。及陳平，晉王欲納陳主寵姬<persName id="c-suishu-041-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p002:m0042" ref="3jv_fyp_o96">張麗華</persName>。熲曰：「<persName id="c-suishu-041-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p002:m0050" ref="y4i_pjk_4gn_AA">武王</persName>滅殷，戮<persName id="c-suishu-041-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p002:m0056" ref="42a_nv5_urq">妲己</persName>。今平陳國，不宜取麗華。」乃命斬之，王甚不悅。</p>
</text>
